            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003EAI-powered legal and regulatory review for Umbraco content. Scans document copy for risky phrases \u2014 superlatives, health claims, greenwashing, defamation, pricing deception and more \u2014 fact-checks the underlying claims, and returns a risk score with per-flag suggested fixes. Built on Umbraco.AI and works with any configured provider (OpenAI, Google Gemini, Anthropic, etc.).\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https://marketplace.umbraco.com/package/umbraco.community.legalreview\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022 rel=\u0022noopener\u0022\u003ERead the original article\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/p\u003E"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
